{"term": {"label": "德", "occurrences": 7, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-i", "title": "公孫丑上", "description": "公孫丑問曰：「夫子當路於齊，管仲、晏子之功，可復許乎？」\n孟子曰：「子誠齊人也，知管仲、晏子而已矣。或問乎曾西曰：『吾子與子路孰賢？』曾西蹴然曰：『吾先子之所畏也。』曰：『然則吾子與管仲孰賢？』曾西艴然不悅，曰：『爾何曾比予於管仲？管仲得君，如彼其專也；行乎國政，如彼其久也；功烈，如彼其卑也。爾何曾比予於是？』」曰：「"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "勇", "id": "勇"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "孔子", "id": "孔子"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "文", "id": "文"}, {"form": "服", "id": "服"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "百", "id": "百"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "莫", "id": "莫"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.8109302162163288, "source": "心", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 0.4054651081081644, "source": "心", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 1.791759469228055, "source": "心", "target": "服"}, {"weight": 0.25131442828090617, "source": "心", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 0.11778303565638346, "source": "心", "target": "悅"}, {"weight": 2.68273239311792, "source": "聞", "target": "勇"}, {"weight": 2.1231166051824975, "source": "聞", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 1.4299694246225523, "source": "聞", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 1.6711314814394402, "source": "聞", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 1.6711314814394402, "source": "聞", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.4299694246225523, "source": "知", "target": "勇"}, {"weight": 1.1115156935040176, "source": "知", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 0.8703536366871296, "source": "知", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 1.4299694246225523, "source": "悅", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 2.277267285009756, "source": "悅", "target": "服"}, {"weight": 1.717651497074333, "source": "莫", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 1.8718021769015913, "source": "莫", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.2656663733312759, "source": "莫", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 1.8999730538682877, "source": "文", "target